  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EAF Nansen Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The impact of the Programme: People in partner countries are food and nutrition secure and less poor as a result of improved utilization of the goods and services marine ecosystems can provide.
Outcome 1: Fishery research institutions provide relevant and timely scientific advice for EAF management
Outcome 2: Fisheries manament institutions manage fisheries according to EAF principles 

Core countries in the programme are Morocco, Mauritania, Senegal, Gambia, C&#xF4;te d&#x2019;Ivoire, Togo and Benin, Ghana, Angola, Namibia, Mozambique, Tanzania, and S&#xE3;o Tome and Principe.</narrative>
  </description>
